{
  "_comment": "📜️ Paged-text carrier laws: a retained document published by `paged_text_carrier` reassembles to its payload as the depth-first concatenation of packed Text leaves, independent of record insertion order; a dangling child refuses. `expectedJson` is checked with serde_json as the third-party oracle.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "single-leaf",
      "root": 1,
      "records": [
